      "text": "Nandagokula AC Veg restaurant is a popular vegetarian stop located along State Highway 96 in Devanahalli, situated near the Shri Nakoda Avanti 108 Parshwanath Jain Temple. It is a frequent highway stop for travelers heading toward the airport, Nandi Hills, or Hyderabad on NH 44.\n​Cuisine: Pure vegetarian offering South Indian breakfast classics, North Indian curries, Chinese dishes, and chaats.\n​Timings: Open daily from 8:00 AM to 10:30 PM.",
